  "title": "Package L — affiliate transactions covenant (new family for the corpus)",
  "issuer": "Tidewater Logistics Group, Inc. (synthetic)",
  "scenario": "7.07 prohibits transactions with Affiliates subject to four exceptions: an arm's-length qualitative exception (a), an intra-Loan-Party exception (b), a capped management-fee basket (c) with a no-Default proviso, and a board-approval gate for transactions above $5,000,000 (d). The disinterested-director approval is a qualitative gate that cannot be computed; the management-fee basket is a per-fiscal-year basket with a condition. 'Sponsor' and 'Management Agreement' are defined; the Management Agreement itself is not in the package.",
